        "word_count": 75,
        "duration_sec": null,
        "body_text": "Clips: Reuters Cop31 failed. What happens now? – podcast The longest ever Cop climate talks have ended in failure after countries were unable to agree a deal. The key sticking point was the omission of any mention of fossil fuels in the final draft.",
